config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBLDAC
	bool "libldac"
	help
	  Sony's LDAC Bluetooth audio codec library (encoder, decoder
	  and adaptive bit rate), in the version published by the
	  openvela project under the Apache License 2.0.

	  bluez-alsa uses it to receive LDAC.

	  LDAC is a trademark of Sony Corporation. The NOTICE file of
	  the source says that products using LDAC need Sony's
	  certification; this build is not certified.

	  https://github.com/open-vela/external_libldac
